      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIAMI VICE (1) has missed the frame the last couple but was a Grade 5 winner three back (18.54) at this track over 320m. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the rails draw. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. MINI AURORA (4) looks close to another win after hitting the frame in a nose second (23.16) in a Grade 5 at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Will give a great sight again. CAWBOURNE MASON (8) is better than last start when seventh (24.61) in a Grade 5 at this track over 400m. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Cannot be underestimated. CALL ME SNUGGLES (2) deserves plenty of thought over this journey.",
